      "date": "2026-01-29T11:22:46.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.82 (up from ₹1.19 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.96b (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹290.1m (up 52% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 12% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 2.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 75%. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 20% growth forecast for the Healthcare industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 27% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 34% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
